[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5990671533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170#issuecomment-5990671533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170","id":5990671533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZRJkrQ","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:15:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:16:13Z","body":"cc @Meorge as the problem was bisected to f27afd713d","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5990671533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5994973346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170#issuecomment-5994973346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170","id":5994973346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZVQIog","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T13:01:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T13:01:21Z","body":"I wonder why `hover_tooltip_timer` even exists? Can't it use the built-in tooltips instead? (with `_make_custom_tooltip()` and all)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5994973346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5995173683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170#issuecomment-5995173683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170","id":5995173683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZVcXMw","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T13:13:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T13:13:13Z","body":"> I wonder why `hover_tooltip_timer` even exists? Can't it use the built-in tooltips instead? (with `_make_custom_tooltip()` and all)\r\n\r\n@KoBeWi \r\nAs far as I understand Godot's built-in tooltips (`_make_custom_tooltip`) don't quite fit the script editor's needs:\r\n1 - They disappear instantly on mouse movement, which breaks the clickable documentation links.\r\n2 - They are tied strictly to the mouse position, which breaks keyboard shortcuts (like `Alt + /`) that need to spawn tooltips at the text caret.\r\n\r\nAs for why a new custom timer was added in `f27afd713d` I think it's because the editor previously relied on `CodeEdit`'s internal `symbol_hovered` timer. However, that only fired on valid code symbols. The custom `hover_tooltip_timer` had to be introduced to track hovering *everywhere*, so that error and warning tooltips could be shown on blank spaces and invalid syntax.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5995173683/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5998257750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170#issuecomment-5998257750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170","id":5998257750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZYYmVg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T16:05:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T16:05:42Z","body":"I'm hoping to test this later today, but the code change itself makes sense to me.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSlight side tangent (not necessary for this PR to directly address IMO, but involves the problem):\r\n\r\n> The problem is that the timer was only being canceled when the mouse left the entire ScriptTextEditor container, which often fails to catch the exit event if you move the cursor out of the text box really fast.\r\n\r\nThis may be a bug deeper within Godot that should probably be addressed on its own. The [documentation for `NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_control.html#class-control-constant-notification-mouse-exit) reads:\r\n\r\n> Sent when the mouse cursor leaves the control's (and all child control's) visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided its [mouse_filter](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_control.html#class-control-property-mouse-filter) lets the event reach it and regardless if it's currently focused or not.\r\n\r\nI wonder if the layout is being reconfigured such that the conditions to emit `NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT` aren't always being met...?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5998257750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6020366216","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170#issuecomment-6020366216","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170","id":6020366216,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZtd_iA","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T16:07:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T16:07:35Z","body":"> CodeEdit has mouse filter stop, so the ScriptTextEditor was never even getting mouse in notification unless the mouse hovered the status bar below the CodeEdit.\r\n\r\nYes exactly...I was looking into this too. Because `CodeEdit`'s `MOUSE_FILTER_STOP` breaks the hover propagation chain, `ScriptTextEditor` is never even added to the engine's internal hover list.\r\n\r\nSo when we quickly move your mouse up to the main editor tabs, only `CodeEdit` receives the exit notification, leaving the tooltip timer still running in the parent.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6020366216/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021468422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124170#issuecomment-6021468422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124170","id":6021468422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZuhRBg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T17:11:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:11:11Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021468422/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]